/target

# egui_kittest golden-image test artifacts (never the committed golden itself).
# Brace expansion is inert in git's fnmatch — three separate lines, not one
# `*.{diff,new,old}.png` pattern (design: 2026-07-16-render-backend-decision, finding 10).
**/tests/snapshots/**/*.diff.png
**/tests/snapshots/**/*.new.png
**/tests/snapshots/**/*.old.png

# Harness local-only state (see AGENTS.md § Agent Docs)
/ai-docs/plans/**/*.progress.md
/ai-docs/pr-comments/
/ai-docs/bugfix/trace-*.md
/ai-docs/triage/*.progress.md

# Per-machine / local settings
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
